<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Uber</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">DON BROCO</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Amazing Things</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">04iX6F51I3EVfTn3QX4Qka</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.620" end="00:11.820">Been a long night, I'ma call Uber</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.820" end="00:14.100">Been a long night, I'ma call Uber</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.100" end="00:17.300">Been a long night, I'ma call me a Uber</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.300" end="00:21.070" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.070" end="00:28.690" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.690" end="00:30.460">Been a long night, I've been out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.460" end="00:32.760">I've been dealing with the driver who's sorry for my lot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.760" end="00:34.540">'Cause my country got us mixing our blood</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.540" end="00:36.910">And it's boiling his blood and that's boiling my blood</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.910" end="00:38.410">He won't shut the fuck up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.070" end="00:40.310">Tell you, I don't give a fuck if the world turns brown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.310" end="00:43.020">Tell you, I don't give a fuck, you pull over right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.020" end="00:45.540">Tell me how the fuck you're not afraid to say that kind of shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.540" end="00:47.040">Tell me how you feel safe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.840" end="00:51.410">Tell me how you do it, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.410" end="00:56.450">Tell me how you do it, whoa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.450" end="00:58.780">Are we really doing this?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.780" end="01:01.030">State of the union, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.030" end="01:04.770">Just what are we going through tonight?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.770" end="01:10.910">State of this place, what the fuck are we doing?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.910" end="01:15.350" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.350" end="01:21.690">What the fuck arе we doing?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.690" end="01:23.920">Been a long night, I'ma call Uber</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.920" end="01:26.660">Been a long night, I've been out, driver babbling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.660" end="01:29.070">Ayy, five girls came riding</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.070" end="01:31.550">Ayy, they were getting all excited</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.550" end="01:33.560">Oh, so tell me more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.560" end="01:36.300">Talk, motherfucker, go on, tell me more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.300" end="01:38.670">What you think of the family on the videos?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.670" end="01:41.030">What you think of that muslim religion?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.030" end="01:43.600">What you think about me calling the police</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.600" end="01:45.100">'Cause you told me Islam a disease?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.870" end="01:49.250">How you do it, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.250" end="01:53.920">Tell me how you do it, whoa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.920" end="01:56.300">Are we really doing this?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.300" end="01:58.650">State of the union, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.650" end="02:02.210">Just what are we going through tonight, through tonight?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.210" end="02:08.500">State of this place, what the fuck are we doing?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.500" end="02:14.370" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.370" end="02:16.710">Been a long night, I'ma call Uber</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.710" end="02:19.060">Been a long night, I'ma call Uber</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.060" end="02:24.980">Been a long night, I'ma call me a Uber</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.980" end="02:31.980" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.980" end="02:37.280">What the fuck are we doing?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.280" end="02:40.690" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.690" end="02:46.280">State of this place, what the fuck are we doing?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.280" end="02:51.170" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.170" end="02:59.170">What the fuck are we doing?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.900" end="03:06.110">What the fuck are we doing?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.110" end="03:14.110" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:21.430" end="03:23.910">Been a long night, I'ma call Uber</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.910" end="03:26.410">Been a long night, I'ma call Uber</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:26.410" end="03:28.800">Been a long night, I'ma call me a Uber</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:28.800" end="03:32.800" /></div></body></tt>